OL,3,GOPINIONCWhat's going on with the late
OL,4,CITV 1 news on Fridays?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAre ITV News staff set for a bumper
OL,7,Fbank holiday weekend?
OL,9,FTV listings for Friday 28th August show
OL,10,Fa worrying development.
OL,12,FITV 1 listings indicate that News at
OL,13,FTen will be just 15 minutes long and
OL,14,Fthat there will be no regional bulletin
OL,15,Fto follow.
OL,17,FThe reason? A screening of the movie
OL,18,FSuperman Returns.
OL,23,EPub: 16-Aug-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
