OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINIONCWhat's going on with the late
OL,4,CITV 1 news on Fridays?
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow, of course, Friday 28th is a normal
OL,7,Fweekday even if some people may try to
OL,8,Fescape for a long weekend at the end of
OL,9,Fthe working day.
OL,11,FAnd running a film half an hour or so
OL,12,Fearlier than would otherwise have been
OL,13,Fthe case is hardly a valid reason for
OL,14,Fhalving the length of the news for one
OL,15,Fnight.
OL,17,FSo what is going on?
OL,19,FPerhaps I'm cynical but I can't help
OL,20,Fbut wonder if there is a little
OL,21,Fexperimenting going on?
OL,23,EPub: 16-Aug-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
