OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G3/6
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINIONCWhat's going on with the late
OL,4,CITV 1 news on Fridays?
OL,5,
OL,6,FRecently NAT has often been pushed back
OL,7,Fto 11pm on Fridays although its
OL,8,Fduration has been unaffected.
OL,10,FIs ITV contemplating pushing back the
OL,11,FFriday bulletin or curtailing it?
OL,13,FThat would not be a complete shock.
OL,14,FWhen NAT returned in 2008 it only ran
OL,15,Ffrom Mondays to Thursdays.
OL,17,FITV's commitment to peak time national
OL,18,Fnews is more than met by the hour-long
OL,19,F6.30pm programme.
OL,23,EPub: 16-Aug-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
