PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F141A1786903897
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G4/6
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINIONCWhat's going on with the late
OL,4,CITV 1 news on Fridays?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPermanently ditching the late night
OL,7,Fregional bulletin on Fridays could be
OL,8,Fmore problematic. The minutes may need
OL,9,Fto be made up elsewhere.
OL,11,FHowever, yet again we find that ITV is
OL,12,Fundermining its news service.
OL,14,FI will say until I am blue in the face
OL,15,Fthat it is not in the wider public
OL,16,Finterest for both main channels to
OL,17,Froutinely show the late evening news at
OL,18,Fthe same time.
OL,20,FThe BBC now owns ten o'clock.
OL,23,EPub: 16-Aug-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14105
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F141A1786903897
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G5/6
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINIONCWhat's going on with the late
OL,4,CITV 1 news on Fridays?
OL,5,
OL,6,FITV should commit to 10.30pm or 11pm.
OL,7,FBut it absolutely needs to lock the
OL,8,Fnews there.
OL,10,FWith the hour long 6.30pm programme
OL,11,Festablished, I would see no issue of
OL,12,Fprinciple with a cut to the duration.
OL,14,FWhether a full half hour is still
OL,15,Fneeded should depend on the demand from
OL,16,Fthe audience.
OL,18,FBut ITV 1 is not C4 or C5. A full news
OL,19,Fservice needs to include a late evening
OL,20,Fbulletin of substance.
OL,23,EPub: 16-Aug-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
