OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINIONCWhat's going on with the late
OL,4,CITV 1 news on Fridays?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlaying fast and loose with the time
OL,7,Fand duration is, as far as I'm
OL,8,Fconcerned, unfair to the production
OL,9,Fteam at ITN and unfair to viewers.
OL,23,EPub: 16-Aug-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
